    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CommunityConnect: save recordings\n\nVoicemails and phone-recorded announcements are stored by Twilio, where opening them asks for the Twilio password. This copies each one into your Supabase storage so it plays with one click on the website.\n\n1. In **Config (recordings)** paste your Twilio Auth Token (same as the other workflows).\n2. Open **Save in Supabase storage** and **Use the saved copy** and pick your Supabase credential.\n3. Save, then **Publish**.\n\nRuns by itself for every new recording, and once for the older ones.\n\n### Voicemail to text\nVoicemails are typed out here (not by Twilio, which costs 5¢ a minute). Groq Whisper costs about $0.002 a minute and understands English, Hebrew and Yiddish.\n1. Make a free account at console.groq.com → API Keys → Create.\n2. Paste the key in **Config (recordings)** → transcribeApiKey.\nTo use OpenAI instead: transcribeUrl = https://api.openai.com/v1/audio/transcriptions, transcribeModel = gpt-4o-mini-transcribe, and your OpenAI key.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "Read Me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
